        "media_grouping_option": "Color,Colour,Couleur,Farbe"
      }
    },
    "custom_liquid_nfW83e": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "Header/Description",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div style=\"max-width:1200px; margin:32px auto 0; font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif; color:#1f2937;\">\n\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:18px; padding:18px 20px; border:1px solid #dbe3ec; border-radius:18px; background:#f8fbff;\">\n    <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px; font-size:30px; line-height:1.1; color:#1f2937;\">How the Custom Impact Screen Builder Works</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#667085;\">\n      The <strong>Elite Sim Golf Custom Impact Screen Builder</strong> is designed to help you configure a golf simulator screen built specifically for your setup. Whether you are replacing an existing screen, building a DIY enclosure, or ordering a custom screen for a new simulator project, this builder allows you to select your finished dimensions, screen material, and finishing options so your order matches your installation needs as closely as possible.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr)); gap:18px; margin-bottom:18px;\">\n    <div style=\"border:1px solid #dbe3ec; border-radius:18px; background:#fff; padding:18px;\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px; font-size:20px; color:#1f2937;\">Purpose of the Builder</h3>\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.7; color:#667085;\">\n        This builder is meant to simplify the custom ordering process by giving you a structured way to size your screen correctly and choose the finishing details needed for your space. It is especially useful for customers ordering screens for DIY EMT frames, custom-built bays, replacement applications, and enclosures that require specific attachment methods such as grommets, pockets, ball bungees, or zip ties.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"border:1px solid #dbe3ec; border-radius:18px; background:#fff; padding:18px;\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px; font-size:20px; color:#1f2937;\">Before You Order</h3>\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.7; color:#667085;\">\n        Always measure carefully and think through exactly how the screen will attach to your frame or enclosure. A custom screen is built to the dimensions you provide, so taking the time to verify your measurements and mounting method up front is the best way to ensure proper fit and tension once installed.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid #dbe3ec; border-radius:18px; background:#fff; padding:22px; margin-bottom:18px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 12px; font-size:24px; color:#1f2937;\">How to Measure Properly</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; color:#667085;\">\n      Start by measuring the <strong>total inside area</strong> where the screen will sit. From there, you need to account for the attachment method you plan to use.\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; color:#667085;\">\n      <strong>If a side of the screen will be attached using ball bungees or zip ties, deduct 3 inches from that side.</strong> This deduction allows room for the screen edge, the attachment hardware, and the tensioning area so the finished screen does not end up oversized for the opening.\n    </p>\n    <div style=\"padding:14px 16px; border-radius:14px; background:#f7fbff; border:1px solid #d7e9fb; margin-bottom:12px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; color:#205b92;\">\n        <strong>Example:</strong> If your frame opening measures 120\" wide and 96\" tall, and you are using ball bungees on the left, right, and top, you would deduct:\n        <br><strong>Width:</strong> 120\" - 3\" - 3\" = 114\"\n        <br><strong>Height:</strong> 96\" - 3\" = 93\"\n      </p>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; color:#667085;\">\n      If a side is not using bungees or zip ties, and instead is using a pocket or another attachment method, that side may be measured differently depending on how the screen will be retained. When in doubt, it is best to contact Elite Sim Golf before ordering so we can help verify the correct finished size for your application.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr)); gap:18px; margin-bottom:18px;\">\n    <div style=\"border:1px solid #dbe3ec; border-radius:18px; background:#fff; padding:20px;\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px; font-size:20px; color:#1f2937;\">Bottom Pocket</h3>\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; color:#667085;\">\n        A <strong>bottom pocket</strong> is used when the lower portion of the screen will slide over or around a pipe, rod, or weighted bar. This method gives the bottom of the screen a clean, finished look and helps keep the lower edge in position without individual bungee attachment points. A bottom pocket is often preferred when a customer wants a more finished appearance or when the lower edge of the screen needs smooth, even retention across the width of the bay.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"border:1px solid #dbe3ec; border-radius:18px; background:#fff; padding:20px;\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px; font-size:20px; color:#1f2937;\">Bottom Bungee</h3>\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; color:#667085;\">\n        A <strong>bottom bungee</strong> setup uses grommets and individual ball bungees along the bottom edge of the screen to tension it to the frame. This can be a good option when the lower edge needs adjustable tension or when the screen is being attached in the same style as the top and sides. Bottom bungees can make installation more adjustable, but they do create visible tension points along the lower edge and require proper spacing for the bungee hardware.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid #dbe3ec; border-radius:18px; background:#fff; padding:22px; margin-bottom:18px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 14px; font-size:24px; color:#1f2937;\">Screen Material Options</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 18px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; color:#667085;\">\n      The right material depends on your budget, how often the simulator will be used, and the overall performance level you want from the screen. Below is a general breakdown of the advantages of each option.\n    </p>\n\n    <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr)); gap:18px;\">\n      <div style=\"border:1px solid #dbe3ec; border-radius:16px; background:#fbfdff; padding:16px;\">\n<div style=\"height:313px; border:2px #cfd8e3; border-radius:14px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:14px; color:#98a2b3; margin-bottom:14px; overflow:hidden;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0692/9698/0162/files/Premium_Single.png\" alt=\"Description\" style=\"max-height:100%; max-width:100%; object-fit:contain;\">\n</div>\n\n        <h4 style=\"margin:0 0 8px; font-size:18px; color:#1f2937;\">Standard Impact Screen</h4>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; color:#667085;\">\n          The Premium HD Impact Screen is a great entry-level choice for customers building a simulator on a budget. Its 1-ply construction keeps things simple and cost-effective while still providing a clean, bright image surface for casual play and practice. Ideal for lighter-use home setups where affordability is the priority.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n         <div style=\"border:1px solid #dbe3ec; border-radius:16px; background:#fbfdff; padding:16px;\">\n<div style=\"height:313px; border:2px #cfd8e3; border-radius:14px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:14px; color:#98a2b3; margin-bottom:14px; overflow:hidden;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0692/9698/0162/files/Elite_White.png\" alt=\"Description\" style=\"max-height:100%; max-width:100%; object-fit:contain;\">\n</div>\n        <h4 style=\"margin:0 0 8px; font-size:18px; color:#1f2937;\">Elite Triple Layer White Impact Screen</h4>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; color:#667085;\">\n          The Premium Triple Layer Impact Screen is the best all-around choice for most home golf simulators. It offers a strong balance of image quality, feel, durability, and performance. Customers who want a more refined simulator experience typically land here, as it is well suited for regular use while providing a more premium look and feel than entry-level materials.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n        <div style=\"border:1px solid #dbe3ec; border-radius:16px; background:#fbfdff; padding:16px;\">\n<div style=\"height:313px; border:2px #cfd8e3; border-radius:14px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:14px; color:#98a2b3; margin-bottom:14px; overflow:hidden;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0692/9698/0162/files/Elite_Grey2.png\" alt=\"Description\" style=\"max-height:100%; max-width:100%; object-fit:contain;\">\n</div>\n        <h4 style=\"margin:0 0 8px; font-size:18px; color:#1f2937;\">Elite Grey Triple Layer  Impact Screen</h4>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; color:#667085;\">\n          For customers who want a bolder, more cinematic simulator image, the Platinum Grey High Contrast screen is a standout upgrade. Its grey surface helps improve perceived contrast and image depth, making visuals look richer and more refined, particularly in spaces where controlling ambient light is a challenge. This option is ideal for buyers who want their simulator bay to feel more like a premium studio environment.\n\n\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"padding:16px 18px; border-radius:16px; background:#fff8eb; border:1px solid #f3ddb1;\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; color:#8a5a00;\">\n      <strong>Important:</strong> Custom impact screens are made to order. Because every setup can vary, if you are unsure how to account for your frame, attachment method, pockets, or bungee clearance, contact Elite Sim Golf before placing your order so we can help confirm the proper size.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>",
        "full_width": false,
        "show_space": false,
        "boundary_effect": ""
      }
    },
    "custom_liquid_c7ANgj": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "Custom HTML/Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{% if product %}\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\"><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@600;700;800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><div class=\"esg-impact-builder\" id=\"esg-impact-screen-builder\"><style>.esg-impact-builder{--navy:#0A1A3A;--navy-2:#112250;--panel:#F0F3F8;--body:#2a3756;--muted:#6B7390;--border:#E6E9F0;--light:#F8F8F8;--card:#ffffff;--amber-bg:#FFF8EE;--amber-border:#C8900A;--amber-text:#5A4200;--shadow:0 16px 42px rgba(10,26,58,.08);max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 0 40px;font-family:'Inter',system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;color:var(--body);line-height:1.6}.esg-impact-builder *{box-sizing:border-box}.esg-impact-builder h1,.esg-impact-builder h2,.esg-impact-builder h3,.esg-impact-builder h4,.esg-impact-builder h5{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:var(--navy)}.esg-impact-builder .eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy)}.esg-impact-builder .breadcrumb{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.02em;margin-bottom:20px}.esg-impact-builder .breadcrumb a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}.esg-impact-builder .breadcrumb a:hover{color:var(--navy)}.esg-impact-builder .breadcrumb span[aria-hidden]{color:#b9c1d1}.esg-impact-builder .breadcrumb .current{color:var(--navy);font-weight:600}.esg-impact-builder .pdp-top{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(400px,520px);gap:48px;align-items:start}.esg-impact-builder .gallery{position:sticky;top:20px}.esg-impact-builder .gallery-main{position:relative;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--light);aspect-ratio:1/1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.esg-impact-builder .gallery-main img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block;padding:24px}.esg-impact-builder .gallery-badge{position:absolute;top:14px;left:14px;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px}.esg-impact-builder .thumbs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:12px}.esg-impact-builder .thumb{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--light);aspect-ratio:1/1;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:border-color .15s ease;padding:6px}.esg-impact-builder .thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block}.esg-impact-builder .thumb:hover{border-color:#b9c4da}.esg-impact-builder .thumb.is-active{border:2px solid var(--navy)}.esg-impact-builder .buybox{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0}.esg-impact-builder .buybox-vendor{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}.esg-impact-builder h1.product-title{font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,40px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:12px}.esg-impact-builder .rating-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:16px}.esg-impact-builder .stars{display:inline-flex;gap:2px}.esg-impact-builder .stars svg{width:16px;height:16px;display:block}.esg-impact-builder .rating-count{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.esg-impact-builder .price-block{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;padding:16px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.esg-impact-builder .price-label{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}.esg-impact-builder #esg-final-price{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,40px);line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:var(--navy)}.esg-impact-builder .price-note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.esg-impact-builder .buybox-lede{font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--body);margin:16px 0 4px}.esg-impact-builder .form{display:grid;gap:22px;margin-top:8px}.esg-impact-builder .subsection{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:20px}.esg-impact-builder .subsection:first-child{border-top:none;padding-top:0}.esg-impact-builder .subsection h4{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.04em;margin-bottom:4px}.esg-impact-builder .subsection>p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.esg-impact-builder .grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.esg-impact-builder .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.esg-impact-builder label,.esg-impact-builder .field label{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.02em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy)}.esg-impact-builder .help{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.5}.esg-impact-builder input,.esg-impact-builder select,.esg-impact-builder textarea{width:100%;border:1px solid #cdd6e6;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:var(--body);outline:none;transition:border-color .15s ease}.esg-impact-builder input:focus,.esg-impact-builder select:focus,.esg-impact-builder textarea:focus{border-color:var(--navy)}.esg-impact-builder input::placeholder,.esg-impact-builder textarea::placeholder{color:#9aa3b8;opacity:1}.esg-impact-builder textarea{min-height:96px;resize:vertical}.esg-impact-builder .note{border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;background:var(--panel);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);color:var(--body)}.esg-impact-builder .note strong{color:var(--navy)}.esg-impact-builder .material-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}.esg-impact-builder .material-card{position:relative;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;background:#fff;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .15s ease;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:4px 16px;align-items:start}.esg-impact-builder .material-card:hover{border-color:#b9c4da}.esg-impact-builder .material-card.is-selected{border:2px solid var(--navy);background:var(--panel);padding:13px 15px}.esg-impact-builder .material-card input{position:absolute;opacity:0;pointer-events:none}.esg-impact-builder .material-card .mc-tier{grid-column:1 / -1;font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}.esg-impact-builder .material-card h5{font-size:15px;line-height:1.15}.esg-impact-builder .material-card p{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;grid-column:1 / -1}.esg-impact-builder .material-card .mc-from{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);white-space:nowrap;text-align:right}.esg-impact-builder .material-card.is-selected::after{content:'Selected';position:absolute;top:-9px;right:14px;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px}.esg-impact-builder .options{display:grid;gap:12px}.esg-impact-builder .option-row{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;background:#fff}.esg-impact-builder .option-copy h5{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:6px}.esg-impact-builder .option-copy p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55}.esg-impact-builder .option-included{margin-top:12px;font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy)}.esg-impact-builder .suboption-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin-top:14px}.esg-impact-builder .suboption-grid--2x2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.esg-impact-builder .suboption-pill{border:1px solid var(--border);background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;transition:border-color .15s ease}.esg-impact-builder .suboption-pill:hover{border-color:#b9c4da}.esg-impact-builder .suboption-pill label{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;text-transform:none;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--body);letter-spacing:0}.esg-impact-builder .suboption-pill input{width:18px;height:18px;margin:0;accent-color:var(--navy);flex:0 0 auto;position:static;opacity:1}.esg-impact-builder .suboption-pill small{display:block;margin-top:4px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-weight:500}.esg-impact-builder .cta-row{display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:4px}.esg-impact-builder .btn{appearance:none;border:none;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 16px;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;transition:opacity .15s ease,background .15s ease}.esg-impact-builder .btn-primary{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}.esg-impact-builder .btn-primary:hover{background:var(--navy-2)}.esg-impact-builder .btn-primary:disabled{background:#9aa3b8;cursor:not-allowed}.esg-impact-builder .btn-secondary{background:#fff;color:var(--navy);border:1px solid var(--navy)}.esg-impact-builder .btn-secondary:hover{background:var(--panel)}.esg-impact-builder .microcopy{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;text-align:center}.esg-impact-builder .oversize{display:none;border-radius:8px;padding:14px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;background:var(--amber-bg);border-left:3px solid var(--amber-border);color:var(--amber-text)}.esg-impact-builder.is-oversize .oversize{display:block}.esg-impact-builder .buybox-trust{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:20px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}.esg-impact-builder .buybox-trust .bt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start}.esg-impact-builder .buybox-trust .bt svg{width:20px;height:20px;flex:0 0 auto;stroke:var(--navy);margin-top:1px}.esg-impact-builder .buybox-trust .bt strong{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:700}.esg-impact-builder .buybox-trust .bt span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.4}.esg-impact-builder .pdp-details{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(340px,.62fr);gap:48px;margin-top:56px;align-items:start}.esg-impact-builder .accordion{border-top:1px solid var(--border)}.esg-impact-builder .accordion details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.esg-impact-builder .accordion summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;padding:18px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.02em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy)}.esg-impact-builder .accordion summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.esg-impact-builder .accordion summary .plus{font-size:22px;line-height:1;color:var(--muted);font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-weight:400}.esg-impact-builder .accordion details[open] summary .plus{transform:rotate(45deg)}.esg-impact-builder .accordion .acc-body{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--body)}.esg-impact-builder .accordion .acc-body p{margin:0 0 12px}.esg-impact-builder .accordion .acc-body ul{margin:0 0 12px;padding-left:20px}.esg-impact-builder .accordion .acc-body li{margin-bottom:6px}.esg-impact-builder .acc-important{margin-top:20px;border-radius:8px;padding:14px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;background:var(--amber-bg);border-left:3px solid var(--amber-border);color:var(--amber-text)}.esg-impact-builder .acc-important strong{color:var(--amber-text)}.esg-impact-builder .summary-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);position:sticky;top:20px;overflow:hidden}.esg-impact-builder .summary-top{padding:20px 22px;background:var(--navy);color:#fff}.esg-impact-builder .summary-kicker{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9db4d4}.esg-impact-builder .summary-price-lg{margin-top:6px;font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:34px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:#fff}.esg-impact-builder .summary-copy{margin-top:6px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#cdd8ea}.esg-impact-builder .summary-body{padding:20px 22px 22px}.esg-impact-builder .stat-list{display:grid;gap:12px}.esg-impact-builder .stat-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--light)}.esg-impact-builder .stat-label{display:block;margin-bottom:3px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.esg-impact-builder .stat-row strong{display:block;font-size:14px;color:var(--navy)}.esg-impact-builder .stat-value{text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy)}.esg-impact-builder .breakdown{display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:18px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}.esg-impact-builder .breakdown-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45}.esg-impact-builder .breakdown-row span:first-child{color:var(--muted)}.esg-impact-builder .breakdown-row span:last-child{color:var(--body)}.esg-impact-builder .breakdown-total{margin-top:4px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px dashed #cdd6e6;font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.02em}.esg-impact-builder .breakdown-total span{color:var(--navy)}.esg-impact-builder .warning{border-radius:8px;padding:14px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;margin-top:16px;background:var(--panel);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);color:var(--body)}.esg-impact-builder .warning strong{color:var(--navy)}@media (max-width:990px){.esg-impact-builder .pdp-top{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}.esg-impact-builder .gallery{position:static}.esg-impact-builder .pdp-details{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px}.esg-impact-builder .summary-card{position:static}}@media (max-width:749px){.esg-impact-builder .pdp-top{gap:24px}.esg-impact-builder .buybox-trust{grid-template-columns:1fr}.esg-impact-builder .grid-2,.esg-impact-builder .cta-row,.esg-impact-builder .suboption-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.esg-impact-builder .thumbs{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}}</style><nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><a href=\"/collections/golf-simulator-impact-screens\">Golf Simulator Impact Screens</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span class=\"current\">Custom Impact Screen Builder</span></nav><div class=\"pdp-top\"><!-- MEDIA GALLERY --><div class=\"gallery\"><div class=\"gallery-main\" id=\"esg-gallery-main\"><span class=\"gallery-badge\">Made to Order</span><img id=\"esg-gallery-img\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0692/9698/0162/files/custom-elite-white-triple-layer-impact-screen-2101782.png?v=1785073928\" alt=\"Elite White Triple Layer Impact Screen\"></div><div class=\"thumbs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"thumb\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0692/9698/0162/files/custom-premium-single-layer-impact-screen-8543472.png?v=1785073929\" alt=\"Premium HD Impact Screen\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"thumb is-active\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0692/9698/0162/files/custom-elite-white-triple-layer-impact-screen-2101782.png?v=1785073928\" alt=\"Elite White Triple Layer Impact Screen\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"thumb\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0692/9698/0162/files/custom-elite-grey-triple-layer-impact-screen-1072123.png?v=1785073929\" alt=\"Elite Grey Triple Layer Impact Screen\"></button></div></div><!-- BUY BOX --><div class=\"buybox\"><div class=\"buybox-vendor\">Elite Sim Golf</div><h1 class=\"product-title\">Custom Impact Screen</h1><div class=\"rating-row\"><span class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"Rated 4.9 out of 5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"#0A1A3A\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.9 4.8 17.2l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"#0A1A3A\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.9 4.8 17.2l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"#0A1A3A\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.9 4.8 17.2l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"#0A1A3A\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.9 4.8 17.2l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"/></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"#0A1A3A\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.9 4.8 17.2l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"rating-count\">4.9 (127 reviews)</span></div><div class=\"price-block\"><span class=\"price-label\">Your Price</span><span id=\"esg-final-price\">$0.00</span><span class=\"price-note\">Configured below</span></div><p class=\"buybox-lede\">Enter your finished screen dimensions and choose a material. Pricing is matched to the next available stock panel that fully covers your build, with optional finishing upgrades.</p><form action=\"/cart/add\" method=\"post\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" class=\"form\" id=\"esg-product-form\">\n{% if product.has_only_default_variant %}\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"id\" value=\"{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}\">\n{% else %}\n<div class=\"field\"><label for=\"esg-variant\">Product Variant</label><select id=\"esg-variant\" name=\"id\">\n{% for variant in product.variants %}\n<option value=\"{{ variant.id }}\" {% if variant == product.selected_or_first_available_variant %}selected{% endif %}>\n{{ variant.title }}\n</option>\n{% endfor %}\n</select></div>\n{% endif %}\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"quantity\" id=\"esg-quantity\" value=\"1\"><div class=\"subsection\"><h4>Finished Dimensions</h4><p>Enter the final usable screen size for your build.</p><div class=\"grid-2\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"esg-width\">Finished Width (inches)</label><input type=\"number\" min=\"1\" step=\"0.01\" id=\"esg-width\" value=\"120\"><div class=\"help\">Final usable finished width.</div></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"esg-height\">Finished Height (inches)</label><input type=\"number\" min=\"1\" step=\"0.01\" id=\"esg-height\" value=\"96\"><div class=\"help\">Final usable finished height.</div></div></div></div><div class=\"subsection\"><h4>Screen Material</h4><p>Select the screen material for your build.</p><div class=\"material-grid\" id=\"esg-material-grid\"><label class=\"material-card\" data-material=\"standard\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"esg-material\" value=\"standard\"><span class=\"mc-tier\">Entry</span><h5>Premium HD Impact Screen</h5><span class=\"mc-from\" data-from>From &mdash;</span><p>Single-ply construction with a clean, bright image surface. Ideal for budget-focused home builds and casual practice.</p></label><label class=\"material-card is-selected\" data-material=\"premium\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"esg-material\" value=\"premium\" checked><span class=\"mc-tier\">Most Popular</span><h5>Elite White Triple Layer Impact Screen</h5><span class=\"mc-from\" data-from>From &mdash;</span><p>Bright white triple-layer surface for a crisp image, added durability, and reduced impact noise. The go-to all-around choice.</p></label><label class=\"material-card\" data-material=\"commercial\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"esg-material\" value=\"commercial\"><span class=\"mc-tier\">Premium Contrast</span><h5>Platinum Grey High Contrast Impact Screen</h5><span class=\"mc-from\" data-from>From &mdash;</span><p>Grey surface for richer perceived contrast and image depth. Best for a cinematic, studio-style bay in less controlled lighting.</p></label></div></div><div class=\"subsection\"><h4>Custom Options</h4><p>Choose any applicable finishing upgrades below.</p><div class=\"options\"><div class=\"option-row\"><div class=\"option-copy\"><h5>Grommets</h5><p>Included at no additional charge. Grommets are evenly spaced around the screen every 12&Prime;. If you do not want grommets, note it in the order notes below and they will be removed on your final proof.</p></div><div class=\"option-included\">Included &mdash; $0</div></div><div class=\"option-row\"><div class=\"option-copy\"><h5>Pockets &amp; Bungee Bottom</h5><p>Select a top pocket, a bungee bottom, or both. Each option is $60. The top pocket slides over the top pole or crossbar to create a clean, fixed upper mounting point. The bungee bottom creates a smoother transition from the screen to the turf, improves the look of the bay, and can reduce bounceback by letting the screen move more naturally on impact.</p></div><div class=\"suboption-grid\"><div class=\"suboption-pill\"><label for=\"pocket-top\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"pocket-top\"><span>Top Pocket<small id=\"lbl-pocket-top\">$60</small></span></label></div><div class=\"suboption-pill\"><label for=\"pocket-bottom\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"pocket-bottom\"><span>Bungee Bottom<small id=\"lbl-pocket-bottom\">$60</small></span></label></div></div></div><div class=\"option-row\"><div class=\"option-copy\"><h5>Enclosure Flaps</h5><p>Select any flap options needed for your build. Flaps are 7-inch material extensions that help conceal visible grommets and ball bungees for a cleaner, more finished look, and help the screen blend seamlessly into the enclosure for a more polished simulator bay.</p></div><div class=\"suboption-grid\"><div class=\"suboption-pill\"><label for=\"flap-top\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"flap-top\"><span>Top<small id=\"lbl-flap-top\">$30</small></span></label></div><div class=\"suboption-pill\"><label for=\"flap-sides\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"flap-sides\"><span>Two Sides<small id=\"lbl-flap-sides\">$60</small></span></label></div><div class=\"suboption-pill\"><label for=\"flap-bottom\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"flap-bottom\"><span>Bottom<small id=\"lbl-flap-bottom\">$30</small></span></label></div></div></div><div class=\"option-row\"><div class=\"option-copy\"><h5>Velcro Edge Strips</h5><p>Add sewn-on velcro (hook-and-loop) strips along any screen edge for a secure, adjustable attachment to a matching enclosure or frame. Priced per edge &mdash; select any combination of Top, Left, Right, and Bottom.</p></div><div class=\"suboption-grid suboption-grid--2x2\"><div class=\"suboption-pill\"><label for=\"velcro-top\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"velcro-top\"><span>Top<small id=\"lbl-velcro-top\">$35</small></span></label></div><div class=\"suboption-pill\"><label for=\"velcro-left\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"velcro-left\"><span>Left Side<small id=\"lbl-velcro-left\">$35</small></span></label></div><div class=\"suboption-pill\"><label for=\"velcro-right\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"velcro-right\"><span>Right Side<small id=\"lbl-velcro-right\">$35</small></span></label></div><div class=\"suboption-pill\"><label for=\"velcro-bottom\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"velcro-bottom\"><span>Bottom<small id=\"lbl-velcro-bottom\">$35</small></span></label></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"subsection\"><h4>Project Notes</h4><p>Add any notes you want included with the order.</p><textarea id=\"esg-notes\" placeholder=\"Examples: special fitment notes, enclosure style, install notes, or other custom requests.\"></textarea></div><div class=\"oversize\" id=\"esg-oversize\"><strong>Screen size exceeds stock panels:</strong> The dimensions entered are larger than the biggest available stock panel for this material. Add the requested size to your project notes and contact Elite Sim Golf for a custom oversize quote before ordering.\n</div><div class=\"cta-row\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"esg-add-to-cart\">Add to Cart</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" id=\"esg-copy-summary\">Copy Quote Summary</button></div><div class=\"microcopy\">Final pricing review may still be required for unusual sizing, specialty finishing, or one-off custom requests.</div><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Builder Type]\" value=\"Custom Impact Screen\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Finished Width]\" id=\"prop-width\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Finished Height]\" id=\"prop-height\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Screen Material]\" id=\"prop-material\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Matched Stock Panel]\" id=\"prop-stock-size\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Stock Panel Price]\" id=\"prop-stock-price\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Grommets]\" id=\"prop-grommets\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Pockets]\" id=\"prop-pockets\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Pockets Total]\" id=\"prop-pockets-total\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Enclosure Flaps]\" id=\"prop-flaps\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Enclosure Flaps Total]\" id=\"prop-flaps-total\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Velcro Edge Strips]\" id=\"prop-velcro\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Velcro Edge Strips Total]\" id=\"prop-velcro-total\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Applied Options]\" id=\"prop-options\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Options Total]\" id=\"prop-options-total\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Estimated Builder Total]\" id=\"prop-estimated-total\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Charged Quantity at $1 Each]\" id=\"prop-charged-qty\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Project Notes]\" id=\"prop-notes\"></form><div class=\"buybox-trust\"><div class=\"bt\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M1 3h15v13H1z\"/><path d=\"M16 8h4l3 3v5h-7z\"/><circle cx=\"5.5\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"18.5\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"2.5\"/></svg><div><strong>Free UPS Ground</strong><span>Continental US, no shipping charges</span></div></div><div class=\"bt\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v20M2 12h20\"/></svg><div><strong>Made to Order</strong><span>Cut to your finished dimensions</span></div></div><div class=\"bt\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><div><strong>Ships from Tennessee</strong><span>Real in-stock material, not drop-shipped</span></div></div><div class=\"bt\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 10c0 7-9 12-9 12s-9-5-9-12a9 9 0 0118 0z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"/></svg><div><strong>Local Pickup</strong><span>Lenoir City, TN &mdash; walk-in welcome</span></div></div></div></div></div><!-- DETAILS + LIVE SUMMARY --><div class=\"pdp-details\"><div class=\"accordion\"><details open><summary>How the Builder Works <span class=\"plus\">+</span></summary><div class=\"acc-body\"><p>The Custom Impact Screen Builder configures a golf simulator screen built specifically for a given setup &mdash; replacing an existing screen, building a DIY enclosure, or ordering for a new project. Select finished dimensions, screen material, and finishing options so the order matches installation needs as closely as possible.</p><p><strong>Purpose.</strong> A structured way to size the screen correctly and choose the finishing details needed for the space. Especially useful for DIY EMT frames, custom-built bays, replacement applications, and enclosures that require specific attachment methods such as grommets, pockets, ball bungees, or zip ties.</p><p><strong>Before ordering.</strong> Measure carefully and think through exactly how the screen will attach to the frame or enclosure. A custom screen is built to the dimensions provided, so verifying measurements and mounting method up front is the best way to ensure proper fit and tension once installed.</p></div></details><details><summary>How to Measure Properly <span class=\"plus\">+</span></summary><div class=\"acc-body\"><p>Start by measuring the <strong>total inside area</strong> where the screen will sit. From there, account for the attachment method planned for each side.</p><p><strong>If a side of the screen will be attached using ball bungees or zip ties, deduct 3 inches from that side.</strong> This deduction allows room for the screen edge, the attachment hardware, and the tensioning area so the finished screen does not end up oversized for the opening.</p><div class=\"note\" style=\"margin:14px 0;\"><strong>Example:</strong> A frame opening measuring 120&Prime; wide and 96&Prime; tall, using ball bungees on the left, right, and top, would deduct: <br>Width: 120&Prime; &minus; 3&Prime; &minus; 3&Prime; = <strong>114&Prime;</strong><br>Height: 96&Prime; &minus; 3&Prime; = <strong>93&Prime;</strong></div><p>If a side is not using bungees or zip ties, and instead uses a pocket or another attachment method, that side may be measured differently depending on how the screen will be retained. When in doubt, contact Elite Sim Golf before ordering to help verify the correct finished size for the application.</p></div></details><details><summary>Bottom Pocket vs. Bottom Bungee <span class=\"plus\">+</span></summary><div class=\"acc-body\"><p><strong>Bottom pocket.</strong> Used when the lower portion of the screen slides over or around a pipe, rod, or weighted bar. Gives a clean, finished look and keeps the lower edge in position without individual bungee points. Preferred for a more finished appearance or when the lower edge needs smooth, even retention across the bay.</p><p><strong>Bottom bungee.</strong> Uses grommets and individual ball bungees along the bottom edge to tension the screen to the frame. A good option when the lower edge needs adjustable tension or when attaching in the same style as the top and sides. This creates visible tension points along the lower edge and requires proper spacing for the bungee hardware.</p></div></details><details><summary>Screen Material Options <span class=\"plus\">+</span></summary><div class=\"acc-body\"><p>The right material depends on budget, how often the simulator will be used, and the overall performance level wanted from the screen.</p><ul><li><strong>Premium HD Impact Screen (Entry).</strong> A great entry-level choice for a simulator on a budget. Its 1-ply construction keeps things simple and cost-effective while still providing a clean, bright image surface for casual play and practice. Ideal for lighter-use home setups where affordability is the priority.</li><li><strong>Elite White Triple Layer (Most Popular).</strong> The best all-around choice for most home golf simulators, with a strong balance of image quality, feel, durability, and performance. Well suited for regular use while providing a more premium look and feel than entry-level materials.</li><li><strong>Elite Grey Triple Layer (Premium Contrast).</strong> A standout upgrade for a bolder, more cinematic image. Its grey surface improves perceived contrast and image depth, making visuals look richer and more refined, particularly where controlling ambient light is a challenge. Ideal for a premium studio-style bay.</li></ul><p>Pricing is based on fixed stock panel sizes ranging from 9&frac12; ft to 18 ft wide and 6 ft to 10 ft tall. The entered size rounds up to the next panel that fully covers it. Sizes beyond the largest stock panel require a custom oversize quote.</p></div></details><details><summary>Finishing Options <span class=\"plus\">+</span></summary><div class=\"acc-body\"><ul><li><strong>Grommets</strong> &mdash; included at no charge, spaced every 12&Prime;.</li><li><strong>Top Pocket</strong> ($75) &mdash; slides over the top pole or crossbar for a clean upper mount.</li><li><strong>Bungee Bottom</strong> ($75) &mdash; smoother screen-to-turf transition and reduced bounceback.</li><li><strong>Enclosure Flaps</strong> &mdash; Top ($30), Two Sides ($60), Bottom ($30); 7-inch extensions that conceal grommets and bungees.</li><li><strong>Velcro Edge Strips</strong> &mdash; $35 per edge (Top, Left, Right, Bottom); sewn-on hook-and-loop for secure, adjustable attachment to a matching enclosure or frame.</li></ul></div></details><details><summary>Shipping &amp; Returns <span class=\"plus\">+</span></summary><div class=\"acc-body\"><p>Free UPS Ground shipping within the continental US. Most orders ship the same business day from Tennessee. Local pickup is available in Lenoir City, TN.</p><p>Because each screen is cut to custom finished dimensions, made-to-order screens are non-returnable unless defective. Double-check your dimensions before ordering, or contact Elite Sim Golf for help confirming your finished screen size.</p></div></details><div class=\"acc-important\"><strong>Important:</strong> Custom impact screens are made to order. Because every setup can vary, if there is any uncertainty about how to account for the frame, attachment method, pockets, or bungee clearance, contact Elite Sim Golf before placing the order so the proper size can be confirmed.\n</div></div><aside><div class=\"summary-card\"><div class=\"summary-top\"><div class=\"summary-kicker\">Estimated Builder Total</div><div class=\"summary-price-lg\" id=\"esg-summary-price\">$0.00</div><div class=\"summary-copy\">Updated live based on your current builder selections.</div></div><div class=\"summary-body\"><div class=\"stat-list\"><div class=\"stat-row\"><div><span class=\"stat-label\">Entered Dimensions</span><strong id=\"esg-dimensions\">120 in &times; 96 in</strong></div><div class=\"stat-value\">Your build</div></div><div class=\"stat-row\"><div><span class=\"stat-label\">Matched Stock Panel</span><strong id=\"esg-stock-size\">&mdash;</strong></div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"esg-stock-price\">&mdash;</div></div><div class=\"stat-row\"><div><span class=\"stat-label\">Material</span><strong id=\"esg-selected-material\">Elite White Triple Layer Impact Screen</strong></div><div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"esg-material-tier\">Most Popular</div></div></div><div class=\"breakdown\" id=\"esg-breakdown\"></div><div class=\"warning\"><strong>Measurement Reminder:</strong> Please double-check your dimensions before ordering. Contact Elite Sim Golf if you want help confirming finished screen sizing for your setup.\n</div></div></div></aside></div>\n<script>(function() {\nconst root = document.getElementById('esg-impact-screen-builder');\nif (!root) return;\nconst currency = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US', { style: 'currency', currency: 'USD' });\nconst numberFmt = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US', { maximumFractionDigits: 2 });\nconst ESG_PRICING = {\nSTOCK_WIDTHS:  [114, 120, 132, 144, 156, 168, 180, 192, 204, 216],\nSTOCK_HEIGHTS: [72, 84, 96, 108, 114, 120],\nmaterials: {\nstandard: {\nname: 'Premium HD Impact Screen',\ntier: 'Entry',\npriceByWidth: [400, 400, 435, 470, 505, 540, 575, 610, 645, 680]\n},\npremium: {\nname: 'Elite White Triple Layer Impact Screen',\ntier: 'Most Popular',\npriceByWidth: [600, 600, 650, 700, 750, 800, 850, 900, 950, 1000]\n},\ncommercial: {\nname: 'Platinum Grey High Contrast Impact Screen',\ntier: 'Premium Contrast',\npriceByWidth: [600, 600, 650, 700, 750, 800, 850, 900, 950, 1000]\n}\n},\naddons: {\npocketTop: 75,      // Top Pocket\npocketBottom: 75,   // Bungee Bottom\nflapTop: 30,        // Enclosure Flap - Top\nflapSides: 60,      // Enclosure Flap - Two Sides\nflapBottom: 30,     // Enclosure Flap - Bottom\nvelcroTop: 35,      // Velcro Edge Strip - Top (per edge)\nvelcroLeft: 35,     // Velcro Edge Strip - Left\nvelcroRight: 35,    // Velcro Edge Strip - Right\nvelcroBottom: 35    // Velcro Edge Strip - Bottom\n}\n};\nconst materials = (function() {\nconst out = {};\nObject.keys(ESG_PRICING.materials).forEach(function(key) {\nconst m = ESG_PRICING.materials[key];\nconst stock = [];\nESG_PRICING.STOCK_WIDTHS.forEach(function(w, i) {\nESG_PRICING.STOCK_HEIGHTS.forEach(function(h) {\nstock.push({ w: w, h: h, price: m.priceByWidth[i] });\n});\n});\nout[key] = { name: m.name, tier: m.tier, stock: stock };\n});\nreturn out;\n})();\nconst els = {\nwidth: root.querySelector('#esg-width'),\nheight: root.querySelector('#esg-height'),\nmaterialGrid: root.querySelector('#esg-material-grid'),\nmaterialRadios: root.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"esg-material\"]'),\nmaterialCards: root.querySelectorAll('.material-card'),\nnotes: root.querySelector('#esg-notes'),\nquantity: root.querySelector('#esg-quantity'),\nfinalPrice: root.querySelector('#esg-final-price'),\nsummaryPrice: root.querySelector('#esg-summary-price'),\ndimensions: root.querySelector('#esg-dimensions'),\nstockSize: root.querySelector('#esg-stock-size'),\nstockPrice: root.querySelector('#esg-stock-price'),\nselectedMaterial: root.querySelector('#esg-selected-material'),\nmaterialTier: root.querySelector('#esg-material-tier'),\nbreakdown: root.querySelector('#esg-breakdown'),\ncopyBtn: root.querySelector('#esg-copy-summary'),\naddBtn: root.querySelector('#esg-add-to-cart'),\noversize: root.querySelector('#esg-oversize'),\npocketTop: root.querySelector('#pocket-top'),\npocketBottom: root.querySelector('#pocket-bottom'),\nflapTop: root.querySelector('#flap-top'),\nflapSides: root.querySelector('#flap-sides'),\nflapBottom: root.querySelector('#flap-bottom'),\nvelcroTop: root.querySelector('#velcro-top'),\nvelcroLeft: root.querySelector('#velcro-left'),\nvelcroRight: root.querySelector('#velcro-right'),\nvelcroBottom: root.querySelector('#velcro-bottom'),\npropWidth: root.querySelector('#prop-width'),\npropHeight: root.querySelector('#prop-height'),\npropMaterial: root.querySelector('#prop-material'),\npropStockSize: root.querySelector('#prop-stock-size'),\npropStockPrice: root.querySelector('#prop-stock-price'),\npropGrommets: root.querySelector('#prop-grommets'),\npropPockets: root.querySelector('#prop-pockets'),\npropPocketsTotal: root.querySelector('#prop-pockets-total'),\npropFlaps: root.querySelector('#prop-flaps'),\npropFlapsTotal: root.querySelector('#prop-flaps-total'),\npropVelcro: root.querySelector('#prop-velcro'),\npropVelcroTotal: root.querySelector('#prop-velcro-total'),\npropOptions: root.querySelector('#prop-options'),\npropOptionsTotal: root.querySelector('#prop-options-total'),\npropEstimatedTotal: root.querySelector('#prop-estimated-total'),\npropChargedQty: root.querySelector('#prop-charged-qty'),\npropNotes: root.querySelector('#prop-notes')\n};\nfunction getMaterialKey() {\nconst checked = root.querySelector('input[name=\"esg-material\"]:checked');\nreturn checked ? checked.value : 'premium';\n}\nfunction getSelectedMaterial() {\nreturn materials[getMaterialKey()] || materials.premium;\n}\nfunction findStockPanel(material, orderW, orderH) {\nconst fitting = material.stock.filter(function(s) {\nreturn s.w >= orderW && s.h >= orderH;\n});\nif (!fitting.length) return null;\nfitting.sort(function(a, b) {\nreturn (a.w * a.h) - (b.w * b.h) || a.price - b.price;\n});\nreturn fitting[0];\n}\nfunction updateMaterialFromLabels() {\nels.materialCards.forEach(function(card) {\nconst key = card.getAttribute('data-material');\nconst mat = materials[key];\nconst el = card.querySelector('[data-from]');\nif (mat && el) {\nconst min = mat.stock.reduce(function(m, s) { return Math.min(m, s.price); }, Infinity);\nel.textContent = 'From ' + currency.format(min);\n}\n});\n}\nfunction syncMaterialCards() {\nels.materialCards.forEach(function(card) {\nconst input = card.querySelector('input');\ncard.classList.toggle('is-selected', input.checked);\n});\n}\nfunction getPocketSelections() {\nconst selections = [];\nlet total = 0;\nif (els.pocketTop.checked) { selections.push('Top Pocket'); total += ESG_PRICING.addons.pocketTop; }\nif (els.pocketBottom.checked) { selections.push('Bungee Bottom'); total += ESG_PRICING.addons.pocketBottom; }\nreturn { selections: selections, total: total };\n}\nfunction getFlapSelections() {\nconst selections = [];\nlet total = 0;\nif (els.flapTop.checked) { selections.push('Top'); total += ESG_PRICING.addons.flapTop; }\nif (els.flapSides.checked) { selections.push('Two Sides'); total += ESG_PRICING.addons.flapSides; }\nif (els.flapBottom.checked) { selections.push('Bottom'); total += ESG_PRICING.addons.flapBottom; }\nreturn { selections: selections, total: total };\n}\nfunction getVelcroSelections() {\nconst selections = [];\nlet total = 0;\nif (els.velcroTop.checked) { selections.push('Top'); total += ESG_PRICING.addons.velcroTop; }\nif (els.velcroLeft.checked) { selections.push('Left Side'); total += ESG_PRICING.addons.velcroLeft; }\nif (els.velcroRight.checked) { selections.push('Right Side'); total += ESG_PRICING.addons.velcroRight; }\nif (els.velcroBottom.checked) { selections.push('Bottom'); total += ESG_PRICING.addons.velcroBottom; }\nreturn { selections: selections, total: total };\n}\nfunction calculate() {\nconst width = Math.max(0, parseFloat(els.width.value) || 0);\nconst height = Math.max(0, parseFloat(els.height.value) || 0);\nconst material = getSelectedMaterial();\nconst panel = (width > 0 && height > 0) ? findStockPanel(material, width, height) : null;\nconst oversize = (width > 0 && height > 0 && !panel);\nconst basePrice = panel ? panel.price : 0;\nconst pockets = getPocketSelections();\nconst flaps = getFlapSelections();\nconst velcro = getVelcroSelections();\nconst optionsTotal = pockets.total + flaps.total + velcro.total;\nconst estimatedTotal = basePrice + optionsTotal;\nreturn {\nwidth: width,\nheight: height,\nmaterial: material,\npanel: panel,\noversize: oversize,\nbasePrice: basePrice,\npockets: pockets,\nflaps: flaps,\nvelcro: velcro,\noptionsTotal: optionsTotal,\nestimatedTotal: estimatedTotal\n};\n}\nfunction panelLabel(panel) {\nreturn panel ? (numberFmt.format(panel.w) + '\" \\u00d7 ' + numberFmt.format(panel.h) + '\"') : 'No stock fit';\n}\nfunction updateProperties(calc, roundedCartQuantity) {\nconst pocketText = calc.pockets.selections.length ? calc.pockets.selections.join(', ') : 'None';\nconst flapText = calc.flaps.selections.length ? calc.flaps.selections.join(', ') : 'None';\nconst velcroText = calc.velcro.selections.length ? calc.velcro.selections.join(', ') : 'None';\nels.propWidth.value = numberFmt.format(calc.width) + ' in';\nels.propHeight.value = numberFmt.format(calc.height) + ' in';\nels.propMaterial.value = calc.material.name;\nels.propStockSize.value = calc.oversize ? 'OVERSIZE - contact for custom quote' : panelLabel(calc.panel);\nels.propStockPrice.value = calc.panel ? currency.format(calc.basePrice) : (calc.oversize ? 'Quote required' : currency.format(0));\nels.propGrommets.value = 'Included - $0';\nels.propPockets.value = pocketText;\nels.propPocketsTotal.value = currency.format(calc.pockets.total);\nels.propFlaps.value = flapText;\nels.propFlapsTotal.value = currency.format(calc.flaps.total);\nels.propVelcro.value = velcroText;\nels.propVelcroTotal.value = currency.format(calc.velcro.total);\nels.propOptions.value = 'Grommets: Included - $0 | Pockets: ' + pocketText + ' (' + currency.format(calc.pockets.total) + ') | Enclosure Flaps: ' + flapText + ' (' + currency.format(calc.flaps.total) + ') | Velcro Edge Strips: ' + velcroText + ' (' + currency.format(calc.velcro.total) + ')';\nels.propOptionsTotal.value = currency.format(calc.optionsTotal);\nels.propEstimatedTotal.value = currency.format(calc.estimatedTotal);\nels.propChargedQty.value = roundedCartQuantity;\nels.propNotes.value = els.notes.value || '';\n}\nfunction updateSummary() {\nconst calc = calculate();\nconst roundedCartQuantity = calc.oversize ? 1 : Math.max(1, Math.round(calc.estimatedTotal));\nsyncMaterialCards();\nroot.classList.toggle('is-oversize', calc.oversize);\nif (els.addBtn) {\nels.addBtn.disabled = calc.oversize;\nels.addBtn.textContent = calc.oversize ? 'Contact Us for Oversize' : 'Add to Cart';\n}\nels.dimensions.textContent = numberFmt.format(calc.width) + ' in \\u00d7 ' + numberFmt.format(calc.height) + ' in';\nels.stockSize.textContent = calc.oversize ? 'Exceeds stock' : (calc.panel ? panelLabel(calc.panel) : '\\u2014');\nels.stockPrice.textContent = calc.panel ? currency.format(calc.basePrice) : (calc.oversize ? 'Quote' : '\\u2014');\nels.selectedMaterial.textContent = calc.material.name;\nels.materialTier.textContent = calc.material.tier;\nels.finalPrice.textContent = calc.oversize ? 'Quote' : currency.format(calc.estimatedTotal);\nif (els.summaryPrice) els.summaryPrice.textContent = calc.oversize ? 'Quote' : currency.format(calc.estimatedTotal);\nif (els.quantity) els.quantity.value = roundedCartQuantity;\nconst rows = [];\nif (calc.panel) {\nrows.push('<div class=\"breakdown-row\"><span>Stock panel (' + panelLabel(calc.panel) + ')</span><span>' + currency.format(calc.basePrice) + '</span></div>');\n} else if (calc.oversize) {\nrows.push('<div class=\"breakdown-row\"><span>Stock panel</span><span>Oversize &mdash; quote required</span></div>');\n} else {\nrows.push('<div class=\"breakdown-row\"><span>Stock panel</span><span>Enter dimensions</span></div>');\n}\nrows.push('<div class=\"breakdown-row\"><span>Grommets</span><span>' + currency.format(0) + '</span></div>');\nrows.push('<div class=\"breakdown-row\"><span>Pockets' + (calc.pockets.selections.length ? ' (' + calc.pockets.selections.join(', ') + ')' : '') + '</span><span>' + currency.format(calc.pockets.total) + '</span></div>');\nrows.push('<div class=\"breakdown-row\"><span>Enclosure Flaps' + (calc.flaps.selections.length ? ' (' + calc.flaps.selections.join(', ') + ')' : '') + '</span><span>' + currency.format(calc.flaps.total) + '</span></div>');\nrows.push('<div class=\"breakdown-row\"><span>Velcro Edge Strips' + (calc.velcro.selections.length ? ' (' + calc.velcro.selections.join(', ') + ')' : '') + '</span><span>' + currency.format(calc.velcro.total) + '</span></div>');\nrows.push('<div class=\"breakdown-row\"><span>Custom options subtotal</span><span>' + currency.format(calc.optionsTotal) + '</span></div>');\nrows.push('<div class=\"breakdown-row breakdown-total\"><span>Estimated total</span><span>' + (calc.oversize ? 'Quote required' : currency.format(calc.estimatedTotal)) + '</span></div>');\nif (!calc.oversize) {\nrows.push('<div class=\"breakdown-row\"><span>Cart quantity at $1 each</span><span>' + roundedCartQuantity + '</span></div>');\n}\nels.breakdown.innerHTML = rows.join('');\nupdateProperties(calc, roundedCartQuantity);\n}\nfunction copySummary() {\nconst calc = calculate();\nconst roundedCartQuantity = calc.oversize ? 1 : Math.max(1, Math.round(calc.estimatedTotal));\nconst text = [\n'Elite Sim Golf - Custom Impact Screen Quote',\n'Dimensions: ' + numberFmt.format(calc.width) + '\" x ' + numberFmt.format(calc.height) + '\"',\n'Material: ' + calc.material.name,\n'Matched Stock Panel: ' + (calc.oversize ? 'OVERSIZE - contact for custom quote' : panelLabel(calc.panel)),\n'Stock Panel Price: ' + (calc.panel ? currency.format(calc.basePrice) : (calc.oversize ? 'Quote required' : currency.format(0))),\n'Grommets: Included - $0',\n'Pockets: ' + (calc.pockets.selections.length ? calc.pockets.selections.join(', ') : 'None') + ' - ' + currency.format(calc.pockets.total),\n'Enclosure Flaps: ' + (calc.flaps.selections.length ? calc.flaps.selections.join(', ') : 'None') + ' - ' + currency.format(calc.flaps.total),\n'Velcro Edge Strips: ' + (calc.velcro.selections.length ? calc.velcro.selections.join(', ') : 'None') + ' - ' + currency.format(calc.velcro.total),\n'Estimated Builder Total: ' + (calc.oversize ? 'Quote required' : currency.format(calc.estimatedTotal)),\n'Cart Quantity at $1 Each: ' + (calc.oversize ? 'N/A - quote required' : roundedCartQuantity),\n'Notes: ' + (els.notes.value || 'None provided')\n].join('\\n');\nnavigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function() {\nels.copyBtn.textContent = 'Quote Summary Copied';\nsetTimeout(function() { els.copyBtn.textContent = 'Copy Quote Summary'; }, 1800);\n}).catch(function() {\nels.copyBtn.textContent = 'Copy Failed';\nsetTimeout(function() { els.copyBtn.textContent = 'Copy Quote Summary'; }, 1800);\n});\n}\nels.width.addEventListener('input', updateSummary);\nels.height.addEventListener('input', updateSummary);\nels.materialRadios.forEach(function(r) { r.addEventListener('change', updateSummary); });\nels.notes.addEventListener('input', updateSummary);\nels.pocketTop.addEventListener('change', updateSummary);\nels.pocketBottom.addEventListener('change', updateSummary);\nels.flapTop.addEventListener('change', updateSummary);\nels.flapSides.addEventListener('change', updateSummary);\nels.flapBottom.addEventListener('change', updateSummary);\nels.velcroTop.addEventListener('change', updateSummary);\nels.velcroLeft.addEventListener('change', updateSummary);\nels.velcroRight.addEventListener('change', updateSummary);\nels.velcroBottom.addEventListener('change', updateSummary);\nels.copyBtn.addEventListener('click', copySummary);\nvar galleryImg = root.querySelector('#esg-gallery-img');\nvar thumbBtns = root.querySelectorAll('.thumbs .thumb');\nthumbBtns.forEach(function(btn){\nbtn.addEventListener('click', function(){\nvar im = btn.querySelector('img');\nif (!im || !galleryImg) return;\ngalleryImg.src = im.src;\ngalleryImg.alt = im.alt || '';\nthumbBtns.forEach(function(b){ b.classList.remove('is-active'); });\nbtn.classList.add('is-active');\n});\n});\n(function syncAddonLabels() {\nvar map = {\n'lbl-pocket-top': ESG_PRICING.addons.pocketTop,\n'lbl-pocket-bottom': ESG_PRICING.addons.pocketBottom,\n'lbl-flap-top': ESG_PRICING.addons.flapTop,\n'lbl-flap-sides': ESG_PRICING.addons.flapSides,\n'lbl-flap-bottom': ESG_PRICING.addons.flapBottom,\n'lbl-velcro-top': ESG_PRICING.addons.velcroTop,\n'lbl-velcro-left': ESG_PRICING.addons.velcroLeft,\n'lbl-velcro-right': ESG_PRICING.addons.velcroRight,\n'lbl-velcro-bottom': ESG_PRICING.addons.velcroBottom\n};\nObject.keys(map).forEach(function(id) {\nvar el = root.querySelector('#' + id);\nif (el) el.textContent = '$' + map[id];\n});\n})();\nupdateMaterialFromLabels();\nupdateSummary();\n})();</script>\n</div>\n{% endif %}",
        "full_width": false,
        "show_space": false,
        "boundary_effect": ""
      }
    },
    "custom_liquid_GkqaCe": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "disabled": true,
      "custom_css": [
        "#esg-impact-screen-builder label {font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #1f2937 !important; opacity: 1 !important;}",
        "#esg-impact-screen-builder .checkbox-row label {font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; color: #1f2937 !important; opacity: 1 !important;}"
      ],
      "name": "Impact Screen Builder",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{% if product %}\n<div id=\"esg-impact-screen-builder\" style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;color:#1f2937;\">\n  <style>\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder{\n      --esg-blue:#086ed3;\n      --esg-blue-dark:#065bb0;\n      --esg-blue-light:#e7f2ff;\n      --esg-text:#1f2937;\n      --esg-muted:#667085;\n      --esg-border:#d9e2ec;\n      --esg-card:#ffffff;\n      --esg-shadow:0 16px 42px rgba(15,23,42,.08);\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder *{box-sizing:border-box}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .hero{margin-bottom:18px}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .eyebrow{\n      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;\n      background:var(--esg-blue-light);color:var(--esg-blue);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder h2{margin:14px 0 8px;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,44px);line-height:1.04;color:#1f2937 !important}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .subtitle{margin:0;max-width:820px;color:#667085 !important;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .layout{\n      display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.25fr) minmax(320px,.75fr);gap:22px;align-items:start;margin-top:24px;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .card,\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .summary-card,\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .trust-card{\n      background:var(--esg-card);border:1px solid var(--esg-border);border-radius:22px;box-shadow:var(--esg-shadow);\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .card{padding:22px}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .card-head{\n      display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-bottom:18px;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .card-head h3,\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .subsection h4{\n      margin:0 0 6px;\n      color:#1f2937 !important;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .card-head p,\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .subsection p{\n      margin:0;\n      color:#667085 !important;\n      font-size:14px;\n      line-height:1.6;\n      opacity:1 !important;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .badge{\n      white-space:nowrap;background:#eef6ff;color:var(--esg-blue);border:1px solid #cfe3fb;border-radius:999px;\n      padding:10px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .form{display:grid;gap:18px}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder label,\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .field label,\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .checkbox-row label,\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .subsection label{\n      font-size:14px;\n      font-weight:800;\n      color:#1f2937 !important;\n      opacity:1 !important;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .help,\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .microcopy{\n      color:#667085 !important;\n      font-size:12px;\n      line-height:1.55;\n      opacity:1 !important;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder input,\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder select,\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder textarea{\n      width:100%;border:1px solid #cfd8e3;border-radius:14px;padding:13px 14px;background:#fff;\n      font-size:15px;color:#1f2937 !important;outline:none;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder input::placeholder,\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder textarea::placeholder{\n      color:#98a2b3 !important;\n      opacity:1 !important;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .note,\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .warning{\n      border-radius:16px;padding:14px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .note{background:#f7fbff;border:1px solid #d7e9fb;color:#205b92}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .warning{background:#fff8eb;border:1px solid #f3ddb1;color:#8a5a00;margin-top:18px}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .options{display:grid;gap:12px}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .option-row,\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .material-detail-card{\n      border:1px solid var(--esg-border);border-radius:16px;padding:14px;background:#fbfdff;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .option-copy h5,\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .material-detail-card h5,\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .trust-card h4,\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .stat-row strong{\n      margin:0 0 6px;\n      font-size:14px;\n      color:#1f2937 !important;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .option-copy p,\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .material-detail-card p,\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .trust-card p,\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .stat-label{\n      margin:0;\n      font-size:12px;\n      color:#667085 !important;\n      line-height:1.55;\n      opacity:1 !important;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .material-detail-kicker{\n      font-size:11px;\n      font-weight:800;\n      letter-spacing:.06em;\n      text-transform:uppercase;\n      color:#086ed3 !important;\n      margin-bottom:8px;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .material-rate{\n      margin-top:8px;\n      font-size:13px;\n      font-weight:800;\n      color:#086ed3 !important;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .suboption-grid{\n      display:grid;\n      grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));\n      gap:10px;\n      margin-top:12px;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .suboption-pill{\n      border:1px solid #dbe6f0;\n      background:#fff;\n      border-radius:14px;\n      padding:12px;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .suboption-pill label{\n      display:flex;\n      align-items:flex-start;\n      gap:10px;\n      cursor:pointer;\n      font-size:13px;\n      font-weight:700;\n      color:#1f2937 !important;\n      margin:0;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .suboption-pill input{\n      width:18px;\n      height:18px;\n      margin:0;\n      accent-color:var(--esg-blue);\n      flex:0 0 auto;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .suboption-pill small{\n      display:block;\n      margin-top:4px;\n      color:#667085 !important;\n      font-size:12px;\n      line-height:1.4;\n      font-weight:500;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .cta-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .btn{\n      appearance:none;border:none;border-radius:16px;padding:15px 16px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .btn-primary{\n      background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--esg-blue) 0%,var(--esg-blue-dark) 100%);color:#fff;\n      box-shadow:0 12px 24px rgba(8,110,211,.18);\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .btn-secondary{\n      background:#eef5fd;color:var(--esg-blue);border:1px solid #d7e6f7;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .trust-grid{\n      display:grid;\n      grid-template-columns:1fr;\n      gap:14px;\n      margin-top:16px;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .trust-card{padding:16px}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .trust-icon{\n      width:42px;height:42px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:12px;\n      background:#eef6ff;font-size:20px;margin-bottom:10px;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .summary-card{position:sticky;top:20px;overflow:hidden}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .summary-top{\n      padding:22px 22px 18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0b72d6 0%,#085db3 100%);color:#fff;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .summary-kicker{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;opacity:.92;letter-spacing:.05em}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .summary-price{margin-top:8px;font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,46px);line-height:1;font-weight:900}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .summary-copy{margin-top:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;opacity:.96}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .summary-body{padding:20px 22px 22px}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .stat-list{display:grid;gap:12px}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .stat-row{\n      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding:13px 14px;\n      border:1px solid var(--esg-border);border-radius:16px;background:#fbfdff;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .stat-label{display:block;margin-bottom:3px;font-size:12px}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .stat-row strong{display:block;font-size:14px}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .stat-value{text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#1f2937 !important}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .breakdown{display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:18px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--esg-border)}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .breakdown-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .breakdown-row span:first-child{color:#667085 !important}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .breakdown-row span:last-child{color:#1f2937 !important}\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .breakdown-total{\n      margin-top:4px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px dashed #d8e2ec;font-size:16px;font-weight:900;\n    }\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .breakdown-total span:first-child,\n    #esg-impact-screen-builder .breakdown-total span:last-child{color:#1f2937 !important}\n    @media (max-width:990px){\n      #esg-impact-screen-builder .layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n      #esg-impact-screen-builder .summary-card{position:static}\n    }\n    @media (max-width:749px){\n      #esg-impact-screen-builder .grid-2,\n      #esg-impact-screen-builder .cta-row,\n      #esg-impact-screen-builder .suboption-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n    }\n  </style>\n  <div class=\"layout\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-head\">\n          <div>\n            <h3>Screen Configuration</h3>\n            <p>Set your dimensions and builder selections below.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"badge\">Live Interactive Pricing</div>\n        </div>\n\n        {% form 'product', product, class: 'form' %}\n          {% if product.has_only_default_variant %}\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"id\" value=\"{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}\">\n          {% else %}\n            <div class=\"field\">\n              <label for=\"esg-variant\">Product Variant</label>\n              <select id=\"esg-variant\" name=\"id\">\n                {% for variant in product.variants %}\n                  <option value=\"{{ variant.id }}\" {% if variant == product.selected_or_first_available_variant %}selected{% endif %}>\n                    {{ variant.title }}\n                  </option>\n                {% endfor %}\n              </select>\n            </div>\n          {% endif %}\n\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"quantity\" id=\"esg-quantity\" value=\"1\">\n\n          <div class=\"grid-2\">\n            <div class=\"field\">\n              <label for=\"esg-width\">Finished Width (inches)</label>\n              <input type=\"number\" min=\"1\" step=\"0.01\" id=\"esg-width\" value=\"120\">\n              <div class=\"help\">Enter final usable finished width.</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"field\">\n              <label for=\"esg-height\">Finished Height (inches)</label>\n              <input type=\"number\" min=\"1\" step=\"0.01\" id=\"esg-height\" value=\"96\">\n              <div class=\"help\">Enter final usable finished height.</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"note\">\n            <strong>How pricing works:</strong> Width × height = square inches. Square inches ÷ 144 = exact square feet.\n            The result is then rounded <strong>up</strong> to the next whole square foot for billing.\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"subsection\">\n            <h4>Screen Material</h4>\n            <p>Select your screen material below.</p>\n\n            <div class=\"field\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\n              <label for=\"esg-material-select\">Screen Material</label>\n              <select id=\"esg-material-select\">\n                <option value=\"standard\">Premium HD Impact Screen</option>\n                <option value=\"premium\" selected>Elite White Triple Layer Impact Screen</option>\n                <option value=\"commercial\">Platinum Grey HD Impact Screen</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"material-detail-card\" id=\"material-detail-card\">\n              <div class=\"material-detail-kicker\">Selected Material</div>\n              <h5 id=\"material-detail-title\">Premium Triple Layer Impact Screen</h5>\n              <p id=\"material-detail-description\">Premium screen option designed for strong image quality and everyday simulator use.</p>\n              <div class=\"material-rate\" id=\"material-detail-rate\">$4.75 / sq ft</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"subsection\">\n            <h4>Custom Options</h4>\n            <p>Choose any applicable finishing upgrades below.</p>\n\n            <div class=\"options\">\n              <div class=\"option-row\">\n                <div class=\"option-copy\">\n                  <h5>Grommets</h5>\n                  <p>Included at no additional charge. Grommets are evenly spaced around the screen every 12\", if you do not want grommets please note below in the order notes and we will remove them on your final proof. </p>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"margin-top:12px;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#086ed3;\">Included - $0</div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"option-row\">\n                <div class=\"option-copy\">\n                  <h5>Pockets or Bottom Bungee</h5>\n                  <p>Select top, bottom, or both. Each pocket is $60.The top pocket slides over the top pole or crossbar to create a clean, fixed upper mounting point, while the bottom pocket is designed for use with a lower pipe or bungee-style bottom setup to help control the lower edge of the screen. A bungee bottom is a popular option because it creates a smoother transition from the screen to the turf, improves the overall appearance of the bay, and can help reduce bounceback by allowing the screen to move more naturally on impact.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"suboption-grid\" style=\"grid-column:1 / -1;\">\n                  <div class=\"suboption-pill\">\n                    <label for=\"pocket-top\">\n                      <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"pocket-top\">\n                      <span>Top Pocket<small>$60</small></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"suboption-pill\">\n                    <label for=\"pocket-bottom\">\n                      <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"pocket-bottom\">\n                      <span>Bungee Bottom<small>$60</small></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"option-row\">\n                <div class=\"option-copy\">\n                  <h5>Enclosure Flaps</h5>\n                  <p>Select any flap options needed for your build. Impact screen flaps are 7-inch material extensions designed to help conceal visible grommets and ball bungees for a cleaner, more finished look. In addition to improving appearance, the flaps help the screen blend more seamlessly into the enclosure for a more polished and professional simulator bay.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"suboption-grid\" style=\"grid-column:1 / -1;\">\n                  <div class=\"suboption-pill\">\n                    <label for=\"flap-top\">\n                      <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"flap-top\">\n                      <span>Top<small>$30</small></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"suboption-pill\">\n                    <label for=\"flap-sides\">\n                      <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"flap-sides\">\n                      <span>Two Sides<small>$60</small></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"suboption-pill\">\n                    <label for=\"flap-bottom\">\n                      <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"flap-bottom\">\n                      <span>Bottom<small>$30</small></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"subsection\">\n            <h4>Project Notes</h4>\n            <p>Add any notes you want included with the order.</p>\n            <textarea id=\"esg-notes\" placeholder=\"Examples: special fitment notes, enclosure style, install notes, or other custom requests.\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"cta-row\">\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Add to Cart</button>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" id=\"esg-copy-summary\">Copy Quote Summary</button>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"microcopy\">\n            Final pricing review may still be required for unusual sizing, specialty finishing, or one-off custom requests.\n          </div>\n\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Builder Type]\" value=\"Custom Impact Screen\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Finished Width]\" id=\"prop-width\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Finished Height]\" id=\"prop-height\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Square Inches]\" id=\"prop-square-inches\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Exact Square Feet]\" id=\"prop-exact-sqft\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Billed Square Feet]\" id=\"prop-billed-sqft\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Screen Material]\" id=\"prop-material\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Material Rate Per Sq Ft]\" id=\"prop-material-rate\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Material Total]\" id=\"prop-material-total\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Grommets]\" id=\"prop-grommets\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Pockets]\" id=\"prop-pockets\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Pockets Total]\" id=\"prop-pockets-total\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Enclosure Flaps]\" id=\"prop-flaps\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Enclosure Flaps Total]\" id=\"prop-flaps-total\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Applied Options]\" id=\"prop-options\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Options Total]\" id=\"prop-options-total\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Estimated Builder Total]\" id=\"prop-estimated-total\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Charged Quantity at $1 Each]\" id=\"prop-charged-qty\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"properties[Project Notes]\" id=\"prop-notes\">\n        {% endform %}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <aside>\n      <div class=\"summary-card\">\n        <div class=\"summary-top\">\n          <div class=\"summary-kicker\">ESTIMATED BUILDER TOTAL</div>\n          <div class=\"summary-price\" id=\"esg-final-price\">$0.00</div>\n          <div class=\"summary-copy\">Updated live based on your current builder selections.</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"summary-body\">\n          <div class=\"stat-list\">\n            <div class=\"stat-row\">\n              <div>\n                <span class=\"stat-label\">Entered Dimensions</span>\n                <strong id=\"esg-dimensions\">130 in × 100 in</strong>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"esg-square-inches\">13,000 sq in</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"stat-row\">\n              <div>\n                <span class=\"stat-label\">Exact Area</span>\n                <strong id=\"esg-exact-sqft\">90.28 sq ft</strong>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"esg-billed-sqft\">Billed: 91 sq ft</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"stat-row\">\n              <div>\n                <span class=\"stat-label\">Material</span>\n                <strong id=\"esg-selected-material\">Premium Triple Layer Impact Screen</strong>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"esg-material-rate\">$8.50 / sq ft</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"breakdown\" id=\"esg-breakdown\"></div>\n\n          <div class=\"warning\">\n            <strong>Measurement Reminder:</strong> Please double-check your dimensions before ordering.\n            Contact Elite Sim Golf if you want help confirming finished screen sizing for your setup.\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"trust-grid\">\n        <div class=\"trust-card\">\n          <div class=\"trust-icon\">📐</div>\n          <h4>Precise Sizing</h4>\n          <p>Built around exact finished dimensions for replacement screens and custom enclosures.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"trust-card\">\n          <div class=\"trust-icon\">🏌️</div>\n          <h4>Simulator-Focused</h4>\n          <p>Designed specifically for golf simulator use rather than generic projection applications.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"trust-card\">\n          <div class=\"trust-icon\">🛠️</div>\n          <h4>Flexible Options</h4>\n          <p>Support flat-fee add-ons and custom finishing needs for a wider range of builds.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    (function() {\n      const root = document.getElementById('esg-impact-screen-builder');\n      if (!root) return;\n\n      const currency = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US', { style: 'currency', currency: 'USD' });\n      const numberFmt = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US', { maximumFractionDigits: 2 });\n\n      const materials = {\n        standard: {\n          name: 'Premium HD Impact Screen',\n          rate: 5.25,\n          description: 'The Premium HD Impact Screen is a great entry-level choice for customers building a simulator on a budget. Its 1-ply construction keeps things simple and cost-effective while still providing a clean, bright image surface for casual play and practice. Ideal for lighter-use home setups where affordability is the priority.'\n        },\n        premium: {\n          name: 'Elite White Triple Layer Impact Screen',\n          rate: 6.50,\n          description: 'The Elite White Triple Layer is our go-to choice for customers who want premium all-around simulator performance. Its bright white finish helps produce a crisp, vibrant image, while the triple-layer construction offers the durability and noise reduction needed for repeated play. This is an excellent option for buyers who want a clean look, strong performance, and a more refined simulator experience.'\n        },\n        commercial: {\n          name: 'Platinum Grey High Contrast Impact Screen',\n          rate: 6.75,\n          description: 'For customers who want a bolder, more cinematic simulator image, the Platinum Grey High Contrast screen is a standout upgrade. Its grey surface helps improve perceived contrast and image depth, making visuals look richer and more refined, particularly in spaces where controlling ambient light is a challenge. This option is ideal for buyers who want their simulator bay to feel more like a premium studio environment.'\n        }\n      };\n\n      const els = {\n        width: root.querySelector('#esg-width'),\n        height: root.querySelector('#esg-height'),\n        materialSelect: root.querySelector('#esg-material-select'),\n        notes: root.querySelector('#esg-notes'),\n        quantity: root.querySelector('#esg-quantity'),\n\n        finalPrice: root.querySelector('#esg-final-price'),\n        dimensions: root.querySelector('#esg-dimensions'),\n        squareInches: root.querySelector('#esg-square-inches'),\n        exactSqft: root.querySelector('#esg-exact-sqft'),\n        billedSqft: root.querySelector('#esg-billed-sqft'),\n        selectedMaterial: root.querySelector('#esg-selected-material'),\n        materialRate: root.querySelector('#esg-material-rate'),\n        breakdown: root.querySelector('#esg-breakdown'),\n        copyBtn: root.querySelector('#esg-copy-summary'),\n\n        materialDetailTitle: root.querySelector('#material-detail-title'),\n        materialDetailDescription: root.querySelector('#material-detail-description'),\n        materialDetailRate: root.querySelector('#material-detail-rate'),\n\n        pocketTop: root.querySelector('#pocket-top'),\n        pocketBottom: root.querySelector('#pocket-bottom'),\n        flapTop: root.querySelector('#flap-top'),\n        flapSides: root.querySelector('#flap-sides'),\n        flapBottom: root.querySelector('#flap-bottom'),\n\n        propWidth: root.querySelector('#prop-width'),\n        propHeight: root.querySelector('#prop-height'),\n        propSquareInches: root.querySelector('#prop-square-inches'),\n        propExactSqft: root.querySelector('#prop-exact-sqft'),\n        propBilledSqft: root.querySelector('#prop-billed-sqft'),\n        propMaterial: root.querySelector('#prop-material'),\n        propMaterialRate: root.querySelector('#prop-material-rate'),\n        propMaterialTotal: root.querySelector('#prop-material-total'),\n        propGrommets: root.querySelector('#prop-grommets'),\n        propPockets: root.querySelector('#prop-pockets'),\n        propPocketsTotal: root.querySelector('#prop-pockets-total'),\n        propFlaps: root.querySelector('#prop-flaps'),\n        propFlapsTotal: root.querySelector('#prop-flaps-total'),\n        propOptions: root.querySelector('#prop-options'),\n        propOptionsTotal: root.querySelector('#prop-options-total'),\n        propEstimatedTotal: root.querySelector('#prop-estimated-total'),\n        propChargedQty: root.querySelector('#prop-charged-qty'),\n        propNotes: root.querySelector('#prop-notes')\n      };\n\n      function getSelectedMaterial() {\n        return materials[els.materialSelect.value] || materials.premium;\n      }\n\n      function updateMaterialDetail() {\n        const material = getSelectedMaterial();\n        els.materialDetailTitle.textContent = material.name;\n        els.materialDetailDescription.textContent = material.description;\n        els.materialDetailRate.textContent = currency.format(material.rate) + ' / sq ft';\n      }\n\n      function getPocketSelections() {\n        const selections = [];\n        let total = 0;\n\n        if (els.pocketTop.checked) {\n          selections.push('Top');\n          total += 60;\n        }\n\n        if (els.pocketBottom.checked) {\n          selections.push('Bottom');\n          total += 60;\n        }\n\n        return { selections, total };\n      }\n\n      function getFlapSelections() {\n        const selections = [];\n        let total = 0;\n\n        if (els.flapTop.checked) {\n          selections.push('Top');\n          total += 30;\n        }\n\n        if (els.flapSides.checked) {\n          selections.push('Sides Only');\n          total += 60;\n        }\n\n        if (els.flapBottom.checked) {\n          selections.push('Bottom');\n          total += 30;\n        }\n\n        return { selections, total };\n      }\n\n      function calculate() {\n        const width = Math.max(0, parseFloat(els.width.value) || 0);\n        const height = Math.max(0, parseFloat(els.height.value) || 0);\n        const squareInches = width * height;\n        const exactSquareFeet = squareInches / 144;\n        const billedSquareFeet = Math.ceil(exactSquareFeet || 0);\n\n        const material = getSelectedMaterial();\n        const materialTotal = billedSquareFeet * material.rate;\n\n        const pockets = getPocketSelections();\n        const flaps = getFlapSelections();\n        const grommetsTotal = 0;\n\n        const optionsTotal = grommetsTotal + pockets.total + flaps.total;\n        const estimatedTotal = materialTotal + optionsTotal;\n\n        return {\n          width,\n          height,\n          squareInches,\n          exactSquareFeet,\n          billedSquareFeet,\n          material,\n          materialTotal,\n          pockets,\n          flaps,\n          grommetsTotal,\n          optionsTotal,\n          estimatedTotal\n        };\n      }\n\n      function updateProperties(calc, roundedCartQuantity) {\n        const pocketText = calc.pockets.selections.length ? calc.pockets.selections.join(', ') : 'None';\n        const flapText = calc.flaps.selections.length ? calc.flaps.selections.join(', ') : 'None';\n\n        els.propWidth.value = numberFmt.format(calc.width) + ' in';\n        els.propHeight.value = numberFmt.format(calc.height) + ' in';\n        els.propSquareInches.value = numberFmt.format(calc.squareInches) + ' sq in';\n        els.propExactSqft.value = numberFmt.format(calc.exactSquareFeet) + ' sq ft';\n        els.propBilledSqft.value = numberFmt.format(calc.billedSquareFeet) + ' sq ft';\n        els.propMaterial.value = calc.material.name;\n        els.propMaterialRate.value = currency.format(calc.material.rate) + ' / sq ft';\n        els.propMaterialTotal.value = currency.format(calc.materialTotal);\n        els.propGrommets.value = 'Included - $0';\n        els.propPockets.value = pocketText;\n        els.propPocketsTotal.value = currency.format(calc.pockets.total);\n        els.propFlaps.value = flapText;\n        els.propFlapsTotal.value = currency.format(calc.flaps.total);\n        els.propOptions.value = 'Grommets: Included - $0 | Pockets: ' + pocketText + ' (' + currency.format(calc.pockets.total) + ') | Enclosure Flaps: ' + flapText + ' (' + currency.format(calc.flaps.total) + ')';\n        els.propOptionsTotal.value = currency.format(calc.optionsTotal);\n        els.propEstimatedTotal.value = currency.format(calc.estimatedTotal);\n        els.propChargedQty.value = roundedCartQuantity;\n        els.propNotes.value = els.notes.value || '';\n      }\n\n      function updateSummary() {\n        const calc = calculate();\n        const roundedCartQuantity = Math.max(1, Math.round(calc.estimatedTotal));\n\n        updateMaterialDetail();\n\n        els.dimensions.textContent = numberFmt.format(calc.width) + ' in × ' + numberFmt.format(calc.height) + ' in';\n        els.squareInches.textContent = numberFmt.format(calc.squareInches) + ' sq in';\n        els.exactSqft.textContent = numberFmt.format(calc.exactSquareFeet) + ' sq ft';\n        els.billedSqft.textContent = 'Billed: ' + numberFmt.format(calc.billedSquareFeet) + ' sq ft';\n        els.selectedMaterial.textContent = calc.material.name;\n        els.materialRate.textContent = currency.format(calc.material.rate) + ' / sq ft';\n        els.finalPrice.textContent = currency.format(calc.estimatedTotal);\n\n        if (els.quantity) {\n          els.quantity.value = roundedCartQuantity;\n        }\n\n        const rows = [];\n        rows.push('<div class=\"breakdown-row\"><span>Material base (' + numberFmt.format(calc.billedSquareFeet) + ' sq ft × ' + currency.format(calc.material.rate) + ')</span><span>' + currency.format(calc.materialTotal) + '</span></div>');\n        rows.push('<div class=\"breakdown-row\"><span>Grommets</span><span>' + currency.format(0) + '</span></div>');\n        rows.push('<div class=\"breakdown-row\"><span>Pockets' + (calc.pockets.selections.length ? ' (' + calc.pockets.selections.join(', ') + ')' : '') + '</span><span>' + currency.format(calc.pockets.total) + '</span></div>');\n        rows.push('<div class=\"breakdown-row\"><span>Enclosure Flaps' + (calc.flaps.selections.length ? ' (' + calc.flaps.selections.join(', ') + ')' : '') + '</span><span>' + currency.format(calc.flaps.total) + '</span></div>');\n        rows.push('<div class=\"breakdown-row\"><span>Custom options subtotal</span><span>' + currency.format(calc.optionsTotal) + '</span></div>');\n        rows.push('<div class=\"breakdown-row breakdown-total\"><span>Estimated total</span><span>' + currency.format(calc.estimatedTotal) + '</span></div>');\n        rows.push('<div class=\"breakdown-row\"><span>Cart quantity at $1 each</span><span>' + roundedCartQuantity + '</span></div>');\n\n        els.breakdown.innerHTML = rows.join('');\n        updateProperties(calc, roundedCartQuantity);\n      }\n\n      function copySummary() {\n        const calc = calculate();\n        const roundedCartQuantity = Math.max(1, Math.round(calc.estimatedTotal));\n\n        const text = [\n          'Elite Sim Golf - Custom Impact Screen Quote',\n          'Dimensions: ' + numberFmt.format(calc.width) + '\" x ' + numberFmt.format(calc.height) + '\"',\n          'Square Inches: ' + numberFmt.format(calc.squareInches),\n          'Exact Square Feet: ' + numberFmt.format(calc.exactSquareFeet),\n          'Billed Square Feet: ' + numberFmt.format(calc.billedSquareFeet),\n          'Material: ' + calc.material.name,\n          'Material Rate: ' + currency.format(calc.material.rate) + ' / sq ft',\n          'Material Total: ' + currency.format(calc.materialTotal),\n          'Grommets: Included - $0',\n          'Pockets: ' + (calc.pockets.selections.length ? calc.pockets.selections.join(', ') : 'None') + ' - ' + currency.format(calc.pockets.total),\n          'Enclosure Flaps: ' + (calc.flaps.selections.length ? calc.flaps.selections.join(', ') : 'None') + ' - ' + currency.format(calc.flaps.total),\n          'Estimated Builder Total: ' + currency.format(calc.estimatedTotal),\n          'Rounded Cart Quantity at $1 Each: ' + roundedCartQuantity,\n          'Notes: ' + (els.notes.value || 'None provided')\n        ].join('\\n');\n\n        navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(() => {\n          els.copyBtn.textContent = 'Quote Summary Copied';\n          setTimeout(() => { els.copyBtn.textContent = 'Copy Quote Summary'; }, 1800);\n        }).catch(() => {\n          els.copyBtn.textContent = 'Copy Failed';\n          setTimeout(() => { els.copyBtn.textContent = 'Copy Quote Summary'; }, 1800);\n        });\n      }\n\n      els.width.addEventListener('input', updateSummary);\n      els.height.addEventListener('input', updateSummary);\n      els.materialSelect.addEventListener('change', updateSummary);\n      els.notes.addEventListener('input', updateSummary);\n      els.pocketTop.addEventListener('change', updateSummary);\n      els.pocketBottom.addEventListener('change', updateSummary);\n      els.flapTop.addEventListener('change', updateSummary);\n      els.flapSides.addEventListener('change', updateSummary);\n      els.flapBottom.addEventListener('change', updateSummary);\n      els.copyBtn.addEventListener('click', copySummary);\n\n      updateSummary();\n    })();\n  </script>\n</div>\n{% endif %}",
